I added a FeedforwardGains class. This uses the Builder pattern which is commonly used for constructing complex data objects that require multiple optional input parameters. Builder is a really good pattern to be familiar with for professional coding.

This is very different from the constants IO classes. These include business logic inside of a data object which isn't recommended.
